Third-party components and attributions
---------------------------------------

- Ultralytics YOLO / YOLOv8 (AGPL-3.0)
  https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
  Used for object detection, pose estimation, and court-keypoint inference.

- BoxMOT (AGPL-3.0)
  https://github.com/mikel-brostrom/boxmot
  Used for BoT-SORT / ByteTrack tracker implementations and ReID support.

- ByteTrack (MIT)
  https://github.com/ifzhang/ByteTrack
  Tracking algorithm and reference implementation.

- abdullahtarek/basketball_analysis (MIT)
  https://github.com/abdullahtarek/basketball_analysis
  `analytics/team_assigner.py` was originally ported from this project.

- MediaPipe (Apache-2.0)
  https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe
  Optional pose-landmarker model. The model weights are not distributed here.

- OpenCLIP (MIT), timm (Apache-2.0), Transformers (Apache-2.0)
  Optional team-classification backbones. Weights are downloaded at runtime.

Data and model weights
----------------------

No broadcast video, extracted frames, or trained task-specific weights are
distributed with this repository. Datasets referenced in documentation retain their
original licenses. Scorecards in `eval/` are aggregate measurements; labels for
Wikimedia Commons footage are included, labels derived from research-only broadcast
footage are not.

